---
// src/pages/mission/india.astro — Hope Community Church
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// TEMPORARILY DISABLED — 14 September 2026, at Julia's request.
//
// The real India mission story page (Prabha & Mary, Lonavala — hero,
// intro, updates, prayer points, support/contact details) has been MOVED
// — not deleted, not edited — to src/pages-disabled/mission/india.astro,
// so it no longer builds as a live route. None of that content was
// touched.
//
// This file is a small stand-in: a friendly "back soon" notice for anyone
// who still has an old link, bookmark, or search result pointing at
// /mission/india, which sends them on to the homepage. It deliberately
// does NOT use the shared Layout.astro (no Navbar/Footer) — since it
// redirects within a few seconds, skipping the site chrome keeps this
// quick rather than flashing the full site around a message nobody has
// time to read.
//
// TO RESTORE THE REAL PAGE LATER (same steps apply to mission.astro, the
// overview page, and to romania.astro, right alongside this file):
//   1. Delete this file.
//   2. Move src/pages-disabled/mission/india.astro back to
//      src/pages/mission/india.astro.
//   3. In src/components/Navbar.astro, un-comment the "Mission" entry in
//      the navLinks list.
//   4. In src/components/Footer.astro, un-comment the Mission line in the
//      Navigate column.
//   That's the whole process.
//
// The visible "back soon" card below is deliberately worded to match the
// same card on src/pages/mission.astro and src/pages/mission/romania.astro
// (each file's own dev-comment block above differs, since each describes
// different real archived content — but if you reword the card visitors
// actually see, copy the new wording into those two files too, so all
// three show one consistent message.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>India Mission | Hope Community Church</title>
    <!-- Keep this placeholder out of search results while the real page is offline -->
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <!-- No-JS fallback only — with JS on, the <script> below fires first via replace() -->
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="6;url=/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="unavailable">
      <div class="unavailable-card">
        <span class="unavailable-icon" aria-hidden="true">🙏</span>
        <h1>This page is taking a short break</h1>
        <p>
          We're updating our Mission pages and they'll be back soon. Thank you for your patience —
          and for your prayers for the work they cover.
        </p>
        <a href="/" class="unavailable-link">Go to the homepage</a>
        <p class="unavailable-redirect-note" aria-live="polite">
          Taking you there automatically in a few seconds…
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>
    <style>
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        height: 100%;
        font-family: 'Nunito', 'Century Gothic', sans-serif;
        background: #f7f9fc;
      }
      .unavailable {
        min-height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 64px 24px;
      }
      .unavailable-card {
        max-width: 460px;
        text-align: center;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(13, 31, 60, 0.08);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 48px 36px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(13, 31, 60, 0.08);
      }
      .unavailable-icon {
        font-size: 40px;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      .unavailable-card h1 {
        color: #0d1f3c;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }
      .unavailable-card p {
        color: rgba(13, 31, 60, 0.7);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
      .unavailable-link {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #c9a84c;
        color: #0d1f3c;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 999px;
      }
      .unavailable-link:hover {
        background: #f0dfa0;
      }
      .unavailable-redirect-note {
        margin: 16px 0 0;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: rgba(13, 31, 60, 0.45);
      }
    </style>
    <script>
      setTimeout(() => {
        window.location.replace('/');
      }, 6000);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
